TI  - Multi-Query Cross-Modal Attention Fusion for Cognitive Impairment Recognition.
AU  - Zhao, Minghui
AU  - Gao, Hongxiang
AU  - Qi, Xinru
AU  - Yin, Haiyan
AU  - Song, Yulei
